{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/time-heals.png?t=1744968411\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game tells a captivating story of a 19-year-old young man named Tyler, who has had an unshakable passion for motorsports since childhood.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/Tyler.jpg?t=1744968411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you'll encounter the mafia, detective investigations, and the mysterious death of your father. It's up to you to uncover whether an Italian family is involved and what secrets the criminal underworld is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/detective.png?t=1744968411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time Heals</strong> offers you a thrilling relationship experience. Will you find your one true love, or choose to date multiple women and enjoy the variety? The choice is yours!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/real.png?t=1744968411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a world of mystery, love, and danger. You'll face the mafia, investigate enigmatic events, and uncover how an Italian family is connected to the tragedy of your life. Will you be able to stay true to yourself amid this whirlwind of events?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/1.png?t=1744968411\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/